# The sing-box engine is fetched, not committed.
#
# libbox.so is 77MB per ABI and four ABIs are 303MB, which is not a thing to carry in git -
# colgram-wireguard keeps 18MB there, not 303. The module and its Java live in the repository;
# apply-patches.py reports clearly when the engine is absent rather than letting a build look
# complete while every subscription silently has nothing to run on.
vendor/colgram-singbox/src/main/jniLibs/
